---
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content'; import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import GuideCard from '../../components/GuideCard.astro';
const guides=(await getCollection('aiScamDefenceGuides')).sort((a,b)=>a.data.order-b.data.order);
---
<BaseLayout title="AI Scam Defence for Families" description="Practical family guides for checking suspicious calls and messages, responding to impersonation scams, protecting accounts, and reporting fraud."><Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'Home',href:'/'},{name:'AI Scam Defence'}]}/><header class="page-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">FAMILY SAFETY HUB</p><h1>AI Scam Defence</h1><p class="lede">Slow the situation down, verify through a channel you control, and keep money and personal information out of an unverified conversation.</p></header><section class="section section-tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><h2>A simple response pattern</h2><p>Convincing audio, images, and writing are not proof of identity. Treat unexpected urgency as a reason to check—not a reason to act faster.</p></div><div class="hub-steps"><article><h3>Pause</h3><p>Do not send money, reveal a code, click a link, or install software while under pressure.</p></article><article><h3>Disconnect</h3><p>End the incoming conversation so the requester cannot control your next step.</p></article><article><h3>Verify</h3><p>Use a saved number, official app, or independently found contact route.</p></article><article><h3>Respond</h3><p>Protect affected accounts, preserve evidence, and report through the appropriate official channel.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">PRACTICAL GUIDES</p><h2>Prepare for the situations families face</h2></div><div class="grid-3">{guides.map(g=><GuideCard guide={g} base="/ai-scam-defence/" label="AI SCAM DEFENCE"/>)}</div></div></section><section class="section section-tint"><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Make verification normal</h2><p>A family plan works best when everyone knows they can end a suspicious call without being rude, and when nobody is embarrassed to ask for a second check. Agree on trusted contact routes before an emergency.</p><p>For a broader family approach, explore <a href="/books/ai-scam-defence-for-families/"><em>AI Scam Defence for Families</em></a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
